WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.061
Step 1. Open the encounter.

1.2
00:00:02.061 --> 00:00:06.688
Mark a procedure as entered in error when it was recorded by mistake.

1.3
00:00:06.688 --> 00:00:11.279
Care keeps the record, but hides it from the procedure lists.

2.1
00:00:11.279 --> 00:00:16.876
Step 2. Open the Procedure form. Select the Edit pencil on the Procedures panel.

2.2
00:00:16.876 --> 00:00:20.651
The form lists every procedure of this encounter.

3.1
00:00:20.651 --> 00:00:22.848
Step 3. Find the procedure.

3.2
00:00:22.848 --> 00:00:27.602
Find the row of the procedure that was recorded by mistake.

4.1
00:00:27.602 --> 00:00:31.152
Step 4. Mark the procedure as entered in error.

4.2
00:00:31.152 --> 00:00:34.381
Open the row menu and select Remove Procedure.

4.3
00:00:34.381 --> 00:00:38.392
The status of the row changes to Entered in Error.

5.1
00:00:38.392 --> 00:00:41.515
Step 5. Save the form. Select Save Changes.

5.2
00:00:41.515 --> 00:00:45.123
The procedure no longer shows in the Procedures panel,

5.3
00:00:45.123 --> 00:00:48.630
and the form does not let you change it back.
